# Immune vs Stromal Score in TCGA-PRAD
Is the tumor microenvironment more immune-dominant or stromal-dominant? Do prostate tumors exhibit “hot” or “cold” immune phenotypes? Is immune infiltration associated with tumor aggressiveness? Does FOLH1 relate to immune suppression or remodeling? Does prostate cancer show immune–stromal antagonism? Which immune cell types are most altered in PRAD? Is tumor immune infiltration homogeneous or heterogeneous? Which tumors might respond to immunotherapy? Can FOLH1 be a biomarker of immune exclusion? Does tumor grade reflect immune landscape remodeling?

